Package: amd-video-enhancer
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @PACKAGE_MAINTAINER@
Depends: bash
Recommends: ffmpeg
Homepage: https://github.com/Rolaand-Jayz/AMD-V.E.-
Description: Linux-first AMD GPU video enhancement application
 Native package built from the canonical staged release root.
 .
 This package keeps the application and bundled userspace dependencies private
 under /opt/amd-video-enhancer and exposes only thin entrypoints under /usr/bin.
 .
 Arch Linux on Ryzen 7 7800X3D + Radeon RX 7900 GRE remains the primary verified stack.
 Other distro packages are published as preview builds and should be validated on the target system.
